\label{rem:h3-nonflag}
{\em
The quotient of $\bar{S}=K[x_2,\dots, x_5]$ modulo either one of the following two ideals  has $h$-vector $(1,4,3)$:
\begin{eqnarray*}
J_2=(x_2^2, x_5^2, p_1=x_3^2-x_2x_4,  p_3= x_4^2-x_2x_5, x_2x_3,  x_3 x_4, x_3 x_5 ), \\
